# shell: desktop
# AW-050/AW-053/AW-055: Copy to opens a picker on the folder the window is
# showing; a folder row is ENTERED rather than chosen, and the button with
# nothing picked answers with the folder being shown.
note the picker opens on the folder the window is showing
click-row 1 3
wait 3
menu-pick Copy to
wait 3
menu-pick Choose folder
wait 5
expect-title Open
note a double-click on a folder goes INTO it: the picker is showing sub,
note which is empty, rather than still showing the three rows behind it
click 400 200
click 400 200
wait 5
expect-rows 0
note and the button, with nothing picked, answers with the folder shown
click 675 413
wait 30
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/sub/a.txt
note a COPY, so the original is still where it was
expect-file /tmp/trk_script/a.txt
quit
